{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05845","headline":"与胡居士皆病寄此诗兼示学人二首 一 · 王维","name":"与胡居士皆病寄此诗兼示学人二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一兴微尘念，横有朝露身。\n如是覩阴界，何方置我人。\n碍有固爲主，趣空宁舍宾。\n洗心讵悬解，悟道正迷津。\n因爱果生病，从贪始觉贫。\n色声非彼妄，浮幻即吾真。\n四达竟何遣，万殊安可尘。\n胡生但高枕，寂寞与谁邻。\n战胜不谋食，理齐甘负薪。\n予若未始异，讵论疎与亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05845.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05845","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}